N1 ! integer > 100
N2 ! decimal > 0.07
N3 ! exp upper > 1.1394E6
N4 ! exp lower > 6.0821e-05
N5 ! signs > -0.2 +0.5
N6 ! leading dot > .5
N7 ! trailing dot > 5.
N8 ! infinities > Inf -Inf NaN
N9 ! lower > inf nan
N10 ! eleven > 0.00032928972
N11 ! long > 0.1000000000000000055511151231257827
N12 ! tabs > 1	2		3
N13 ! then text > 1.5 abc
N14 ! text first > abc 1.5
N15 ! d exponent > 1d3
N16 ! commas > 1,2,3
N17 ! empty >
N18 ! hex > 0x10
N19 ! spaces >    3.5    4.5   
N20 ! brackets > [1 2 3]
N21 ! minus zero > -0
N22 ! overflow > 1e309
N23 ! subnormal > 4.9e-324
END
